  "releaseNotes": "Core formalized in Lean 4. Algorithms separated from Results domain. Shifted to ownership-first resolution. Redesigned algorithm opening mechanism and other improvements. Compatibility note for semantic-AST consumers: an undocumented C#-only strict-variadic suffix reshape of manually constructed lone Expr.SequenceConstruct builtin arguments was removed; KatLang source programs are unaffected, and externally constructed nodes now follow the ordinary grouped-value argument path, aligned with the Lean model (see docs/design/sequence-boundary-audit-2026-07.md section 7).",
